{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55616","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十四 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"进退应须与智论，浮萍自在爲无根。\n扫门何太抛途辙，解佩犹能弃渥恩。\n草径旋封迷旧迹，苔阶乱织露新痕。\n不唯此景供游赏。\n无限烟萝尽一吞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}